<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Francisco Holdings Inc. | Phoenix Dominion Empire</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cinzel:wght@400;600;900&family=Inter:wght@300;400;600;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root {
  --gold: #D4AF37;
  --gold-light: #FFD700;
  --platinum: #E5E4E2;
  --silver: #C0C0C0;
  --emerald: #50C878;
  --ruby: #E0115F;
  --diamond: #F0F8FF;
  --black: #050505;
  --black-glass: rgba(5,5,5,0.85);
}
* { margin:0; padding:0; box-sizing:border-box; }
html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
body {
  font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
  background: var(--black);
  color: var(--platinum);
  overflow-x: hidden;
  min-height: 100vh;
}
#particle-canvas {
  position: fixed; top:0; left:0; width:100%; height:100%;
  z-index: 0; pointer-events: none;
}
.glass {
  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
  backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
  border: 1px solid rgba(212,175,55,0.15);
  border-radius: 16px;
}
.glass-strong {
  background: rgba(5,5,5,0.7);
  backdrop-filter: blur(30px);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(30px);
  border: 1px solid rgba(212,175,55,0.2);
  border-radius: 20px;
}
.glow-gold { box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(212,175,55,0.15), inset 0 0 40px rgba(212,175,55,0.05); }
.glow-emerald { box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(80,200,120,0.15), inset 0 0 40px rgba(80,200,120,0.05); }
.glow-ruby { box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(224,17,95,0.15), inset 0 0 40px rgba(224,17,95,0.05); }

/* NAV */
nav {
  position: fixed; top:0; left:0; width:100%; z-index:1000;
  padding: 20px 40px;
  display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
  background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(5,5,5,0.95) 0%, transparent 100%);
}
.nav-logo {
  font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 900;
  color: var(--gold); letter-spacing: 4px;
  text-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(212,175,55,0.4);
}
.nav-links { display: flex; gap: 30px; align-items: center; }
.nav-links a {
  color: var(--silver); text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.75rem;
  text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 2px; font-weight: 600;
  transition: all 0.3s; position: relative;
}
.nav-links a::after {
  content:''; position: absolute; bottom: -4px; left:0; width:0; height:1px;
  background: var(--gold); transition: width 0.3s;
}
.nav-links a:hover { color: var(--gold); }
.nav-links a:hover::after { width: 100%; }
.nav-cta {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--gold), #B8941F);
  color: var(--black) !important; padding: 10px 24px; border-radius: 30px;
  font-weight: 800; font-size: 0.7rem; letter-spacing: 2px;
  border: none; cursor: pointer; text-transform: uppercase;
  box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(212,175,55,0.3);
  transition: all 0.3s;
}
.nav-cta:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 5px 30px rgba(212,175,55,0.5); }

/* HERO */
.hero {
  position: relative; z-index: 1;
  min-height: 100vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column;
  justify-content: center; align-items: center; text-align: center;
  padding: 120px 20px 80px;
}
.hero-badge {
  display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
  padding: 8px 20px; border-radius: 30px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(212,175,55,0.3);
  font-size: 0.7rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 3px;
  color: var(--gold); margin-bottom: 30px;
  background: rgba(212,175,55,0.05);
}
.hero-badge .pulse {
  width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--emerald);
  animation: pulse 2s infinite; box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--emerald);
}
@keyframes pulse { 0%,100%{opacity:1} 50%{opacity:0.3} }

.hero h1 {
  font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 8vw, 7rem);
  font-weight: 900; line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -1px;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--gold) 0%, var(--platinum) 50%, var(--gold) 100%);
  -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  background-clip: text; margin-bottom: 20px;
  filter: drop-shadow(0 0 40px rgba(212,175,55,0.3));
}
.hero-subtitle {
  font-size: clamp(1rem, 2.5vw, 1.5rem); color: var(--silver);
  font-weight: 300; letter-spacing: 6px; text-transform: uppercase;
  margin-bottom: 40px;
}
.hero-desc {
  max-width: 700px; font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.8;
  color: rgba(229,228,226,0.7); margin-bottom: 50px;
}
.hero-stats {
  display: flex; gap: 60px; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap;
  margin-bottom: 50px;
}
.stat { text-align: center; }
.stat-num {
  font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: 2.5rem; font-weight: 900;
  color: var(--gold); display: block;
}
.stat-label {
  font-size: 0.7rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 3px;
  color: var(--silver); margin-top: 5px;
}
.hero-ctas {
  display: flex; gap: 20px; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center;
}
.btn-primary {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--gold), #B8941F);
  color: var(--black); padding: 16px 40px; border-radius: 30px;
  font-weight: 800; font-size: 0.8rem; letter-spacing: 2px;
  text-transform: uppercase; text-decoration: none;
  border: none; cursor: pointer;
  box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(212,175,55,0.3);
  transition: all 0.3s; display: inline-block;
}
.btn-primary:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(212,175,55,0.5); }
.btn-secondary {
  background: transparent; color: var(--gold);
  padding: 16px 40px; border-radius: 30px;
  font-weight: 800; font-size: 0.8rem; letter-spacing: 2px;
  text-transform: uppercase; text-decoration: none;
  border: 1px solid rgba(212,175,55,0.4);
  cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.3s; display: inline-block;
}
.btn-secondary:hover { background: rgba(212,175,55,0.1); border-color: var(--gold); }

/* SECTIONS */
section { position: relative; z-index: 1; padding: 100px 20px; }
.container { max-width: 1400px; margin: 0 auto; }
.section-header {
  text-align: center; margin-bottom: 80px;
}
.section-header h2 {
  font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
  font-weight: 900; color: var(--gold); margin-bottom: 15px;
  letter-spacing: 2px;
}
.section-header p {
  font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--silver); max-width: 700px;
  margin: 0 auto; line-height: 1.7;
}
.section-label {
  display: inline-block; padding: 6px 16px; border-radius: 20px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(212,175,55,0.3); color: var(--gold);
  font-size: 0.65rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 3px;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
}

/* MISSION */
.mission-grid {
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 60px; align-items: center;
}
.mission-text h3 {
  font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: 2rem; color: var(--platinum);
  margin-bottom: 20px; line-height: 1.3;
}
.mission-text p {
  font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.9; color: rgba(229,228,226,0.7);
  margin-bottom: 20px;
}
.mission-visual {
  position: relative; height: 500px; display: flex;
  justify-content: center; align-items: center;
}
.phoenix-ring {
  width: 350px; height: 350px; border-radius: 50%;
  border: 2px solid rgba(212,175,55,0.2);
  position: relative; animation: rotate 20s linear infinite;
}
.phoenix-ring::before, .phoenix-ring::after {
  content:''; position: absolute; border-radius: 50%;
  border: 1px solid rgba(212,175,55,0.1);
}
.phoenix-ring::before { top:20px; left:20px; right:20px; bottom:20px; }
.phoenix-ring::after { top:50px; left:50px; right:50px; bottom:50px; }
@keyframes rotate { from{transform:rotate(0deg)} to{transform:rotate(360deg)} }
.phoenix-core {
  position: absolute; width: 120px; height: 120px; border-radius: 50%;
  background: radial-gradient(circle, var(--gold) 0%, transparent 70%);
  filter: blur(20px); opacity: 0.6; animation: breathe 3s ease-in-out infinite;
}
@keyframes breathe { 0%,100%{transform:scale(1);opacity:0.6} 50%{transform:scale(1.2);opacity:0.9} }
.phoenix-icon {
  position: absolute; font-size: 4rem;
  filter: drop-shadow(0 0 20px var(--gold));
}
@media(max-width:900px){ .mission-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr} }

/* PRODUCTS */
.products-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
  gap: 25px;
}
.product-card {
  padding: 35px; position: relative; overflow: hidden;
  transition: all 0.4s; cursor: pointer;
}
.product-card::before {
  content:''; position: absolute; top:0; left:0; width:100%; height:3px;
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--gold), transparent);
  opacity: 0; transition: opacity 0.3s;
}
.product-card:hover::before { opacity: 1; }
.product-card:hover {
  transform: translateY(-8px);
  box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(212,175,55,0.1), 0 0 40px rgba(212,175,55,0.05);
  border-color: rgba(212,175,55,0.4);
}
.product-icon {
  width: 60px; height: 60px; border-radius: 16px;
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  font-size: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 20px;
  background: rgba(212,175,55,0.08);
  border: 1px solid rgba(212,175,55,0.15);
}
.product-card h4 {
  font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--platinum);
  margin-bottom: 12px; letter-spacing: 1px;
}
.product-card p {
  font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.7; color: rgba(229,228,226,0.6);
}
.product-tag {
  display: inline-block; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 12px;
  font-size: 0.6rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 2px;
  margin-top: 15px; font-weight: 700;
}
.tag-gold { background: rgba(212,175,55,0.1); color: var(--gold); border: 1px solid rgba(212,175,55,0.2); }
.tag-emerald { background: rgba(80,200,120,0.1); color: var(--emerald); border: 1px solid rgba(80,200,120,0.2); }
.tag-ruby { background: rgba(224,17,95,0.1); color: var(--ruby); border: 1px solid rgba(224,17,95,0.2); }

/* ABOUT */
.about-grid {
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 80px; align-items: center;
}
.about-img-wrap {
  position: relative; padding: 40px;
}
.about-img-frame {
  width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 1; border-radius: 20px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(212,175,55,0.2);
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(212,175,55,0.05), rgba(80,200,120,0.05));
  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  font-size: 6rem;
}
.about-text h3 {
  font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: 2.2rem; color: var(--gold);
  margin-bottom: 25px; line-height: 1.2;
}
.about-text p {
  font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.9; color: rgba(229,228,226,0.7);
  margin-bottom: 20px;
}
.about-quote {
  border-left: 3px solid var(--gold); padding-left: 25px;
  margin: 30px 0; font-style: italic;
  font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--platinum); line-height: 1.7;
}
@media(max-width:900px){ .about-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr} }

/* REVENUE */
.revenue-section { background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent, rgba(212,175,55,0.03), transparent); }
.pricing-grid {
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 30px;
  max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto;
}
.pricing-card {
  padding: 50px 35px; text-align: center; position: relative;
  transition: all 0.4s;
}
.pricing-card.featured {
  border-color: rgba(212,175,55,0.4);
  transform: scale(1.05);
}
.pricing-card.featured::before {
  content: 'MOST POPULAR'; position: absolute; top:-12px; left:50%; transform:translateX(-50%);
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--gold), #B8941F);
  color: var(--black); padding: 6px 20px; border-radius: 20px;
  font-size: 0.6rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 2px;
}
.pricing-card:hover { transform: translateY(-10px); }
.pricing-card.featured:hover { transform: scale(1.05) translateY(-10px); }
.pricing-name {
  font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: 1.3rem; color: var(--platinum);
  margin-bottom: 10px; letter-spacing: 2px;
}
.pricing-price {
  font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: 3rem; font-weight: 900;
  color: var(--gold); margin-bottom: 5px;
}
.pricing-price span { font-size: 1rem; color: var(--silver); font-weight: 400; }
.pricing-desc { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--silver); margin-bottom: 30px; }
.pricing-features { list-style: none; margin-bottom: 35px; }
.pricing-features li {
  padding: 10px 0; font-size: 0.85rem; color: rgba(229,228,226,0.7);
  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
}
@media(max-width:900px){ .pricing-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr} .pricing-card.featured{transform:scale(1)} }

/* CROSS EMPIRE */
.cross-empire {
  display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 30px;
  max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;
}
.empire-link {
  padding: 40px; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; color: inherit;
  display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 15px;
  transition: all 0.4s;
}
.empire-link:hover { transform: translateY(-5px); border-color: var(--gold); }
.empire-link .icon { font-size: 3rem; }
.empire-link h4 { font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: 1.2rem; color: var(--gold); }
.empire-link p { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--silver); }

/* FOOTER */
footer {
  position: relative; z-index: 1;
  padding: 60px 20px 30px; text-align: center;
  border-top: 1px solid rgba(212,175,55,0.1);
}
.footer-logo {
  font-family: 'Cinzel', serif; font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 900;
  color: var(--gold); letter-spacing: 4px; margin-bottom: 20px;
}
.footer-links {
  display: flex; gap: 30px; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap;
  margin-bottom: 30px;
}
.footer-links a {
  color: var(--silver); text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.8rem;
  text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 2px;
  transition: color 0.3s;
}
.footer-links a:hover { color: var(--gold); }
.footer-disclaimer {
  max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto 20px;
  font-size: 0.75rem; color: rgba(229,228,226,0.4);
  line-height: 1.7;
}
.footer-copy {
  font-size: 0.7rem; color: rgba(229,228,226,0.3);
  letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase;
}

/* ANIMATIONS */
.reveal {
  opacity: 0; transform: translateY(40px);
  transition: all 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
}
.reveal.visible { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }

/* SCROLLBAR */
::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 6px; }
::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: var(--black); }
::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: rgba(212,175,55,0.3); border-radius: 3px; }
::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover { background: rgba(212,175,55,0.5); }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<canvas id="particle-canvas"></canvas>

<nav>
  <div class="nav-logo">FHI</div>
  <div class="nav-links">
    <a href="#mission">Mission</a>
    <a href="#products">Empire</a>
    <a href="#about">About</a>
    <a href="#revenue">Invest</a>
    <a href="https://zprimedoxaihq.com" target="_blank">🧠 PrimeDox</a>
    <a href="https://omniaguard.com" target="_blank">🛡️ OmniAGuard</a>
    <a href="#revenue" class="nav-cta">Enter Empire</a>
  </div>
</nav>

<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-badge reveal"><span class="pulse"></span> Phoenix Dominion Active</div>
  <h1 class="reveal">FRANCISCO<br>HOLDINGS INC.</h1>
  <p class="hero-subtitle reveal">The Empire That Builds Empires</p>
  <p class="hero-desc reveal">
    A vertically integrated global conglomerate spanning 45+ companies, AI agent swarms, 
    cybersecurity, luxury brokerage, constitutional law education, and cannabis consulting. 
    We don't participate in markets — we dominate them.
  </p>
  <div class="hero-stats reveal">
    <div class="stat"><span class="stat-num">45+</span><div class="stat-label">Companies</div></div>
    <div class="stat"><span class="stat-num">12,847</span><div class="stat-label">AI Agents</div></div>
    <div class="stat"><span class="stat-num">392</span><div class="stat-label">Empire Floors</div></div>
    <div class="stat"><span class="stat-num">$3.3M</span><div class="stat-label">Active Claim</div></div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-ctas reveal">
    <a href="#products" class="btn-primary">Explore the Empire</a>
    <a href="#revenue" class="btn-secondary">Partner With Us</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="mission">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header reveal">
      <span class="section-label">Our Purpose</span>
      <h2>Mission Statement</h2>
      <p>To disrupt every global market through vertical integration, agentic AI, and uncompromising excellence. We build what others dream.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="mission-grid">
      <div class="mission-text reveal">
        <h3>Dream-Core & Phoenix-Core</h3>
        <p><strong>Dream-Core</strong> is the vision engine — where impossible ideas become architectural reality. Every company in our portfolio begins as a Dream-Core projection: analyzed, stress-tested, and built to dominate.</p>
        <p><strong>Phoenix-Core</strong> is the execution engine — the immortal flame that rises from every setback stronger than before. It powers our agent swarm, our litigation strategy, and our global expansion.</p>
        <p>Together, they form the operating system of Francisco Holdings Inc. — a trillion-dollar mindset operating at startup speed.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mission-visual reveal">
        <div class="phoenix-ring"></div>
        <div class="phoenix-core"></div>
        <div class="phoenix-icon">🔥</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="products" style="background:linear-gradient(180deg, transparent, rgba(212,175,55,0.02), transparent);">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header reveal">
      <span class="section-label">The Portfolio</span>
      <h2>Empire Products & Services</h2>
      <p>Every industry. Every niche. Problems identified, gaps filled, revenue guaranteed.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="products-grid">
      <div class="product-card glass glow-gold reveal">
        <div class="product-icon">👑</div>
        <h4>Empire Portfolio Management</h4>
        <p>Centralized command and control for 45+ operating companies. Real-time dashboards, cross-subsidiary analytics, and unified resource allocation.</p>
        <span class="product-tag tag-gold">Holding Company</span>
      </div>
      <div class="product-card glass glow-gold reveal">
        <div class="product-icon">🧠</div>
        <h4>PrimeDox AI Concierge</h4>
        <p>Agentic AI that routes every business task to the correct specialist AI. Legal docs, real estate closings, corporate filings — automated end-to-end.</p>
        <span class="product-tag tag-gold">Artificial Intelligence</span>
      </div>
      <div class="product-card glass glow-emerald reveal">
        <div class="product-icon">🛡️</div>
        <h4>OmniAGuard Cybersecurity</h4>
        <p>World's first agentic AI cybersecurity platform. Honeycomb defense grid, autonomous threat neutralization, and 24/7 empire lockdown protocols.</p>
        <span class="product-tag tag-emerald">Security</span>
      </div>
      <div class="product-card glass glow-gold reveal">
        <div class="product-icon">🏎️</div>
        <h4>Vault Velocity Auto</h4>
        <p>Luxury brokerage for supercars, private jets, yachts, helicopters, and armored vehicles. White-glove concierge. 5-10% brokerage, $50K-$500K sourcing fees.</p>
        <span class="product-tag tag-gold">Luxury Brokerage</span>
      </div>
      <div class="product-card glass glow-emerald reveal">
        <div class="product-icon">⚖️</div>
        <h4>CCLDR Constitutional Law</h4>
        <p>Cannabis Constitutional Law Digital Resource. The definitive archive for lawyers and paralegals on medical marijuana law, Charter arguments, and precedent.</p>
        <span class="product-tag tag-emerald">Legal Education</span>
      </div>
      <div class="product-card glass glow-emerald reveal">
        <div class="product-icon">🌿</div>
        <h4>CCC Cannabis Consulting</h4>
        <p>A-to-Z cannabis industry superhighway. 20 years of expertise. Licensing, compliance, SOPs, regulatory navigation — the complete vertical.</p>
        <span class="product-tag tag-emerald">Cannabis</span>
      </div>
      <div class="product-card glass glow-ruby reveal">
        <div class="product-icon">📚</div>
        <h4>Weedlaw Education Platform</h4>
        <p>The most dangerous legal education platform in the world. Constitutional advocacy, self-representation mastery, and cannabis law history dating back to 2000.</p>
        <span class="product-tag tag-ruby">Education</span>
      </div>
      <div class="product-card glass glow-gold reveal">
        <div class="product-icon">🏢</div>
        <h4>Francisco Holdings Real Estate</h4>
        <p>Property sales integrated with legal services. Capture full commission + legal fees. Vertical integration of the real estate transaction from listing to closing.</p>
        <span class="product-tag tag-gold">Real Estate</span>
      </div>
      <div class="product-card glass glow-gold reveal">
        <div class="product-icon">🤖</div>
        <h4>Agent Swarm Technology</h4>
        <p>Neural graph-powered multi-agent systems that automate entire business workflows. 100x better than Make.com, Zapier, or Jarvis. Self-orchestrating, self-healing.</p>
        <span class="product-tag tag-gold">Automation</span>
      </div>
      <div class="product-card glass glow-gold reveal">
        <div class="product-icon">💰</div>
        <h4>Phoenix Dominion Capital</h4>
        <p>Venture funding and investment arm. We invest in disruptive technologies, distressed assets, and high-velocity market opportunities across all sectors.</p>
        <span class="product-tag tag-gold">Investment</span>
      </div>
